+
+| ID | Lines | Claim | Review |
+|---|---:|---|---|
+| C01 | 10–21 | Loop state 0 | Exact loop head and continuation; postcondition is `scan(0,BS)`. |
+| C02 | 23–34 | Loop state 1 | Same with state/result summary 1. |
